sequenceDiagram
    participant PS as Post Service
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant CC as InternalCategoryController
    participant CS as CategoryService
    participant CR as CategoryRepository
    participant TR as TagRepository
    participant DB as MySQL (category_db)
    participant RMQ as RabbitMQ

    Note over PS,RMQ: Taxonomy Sync (Feign Call from Post Service)
    PS->>GW: POST /api/categories/internal/posts/{postId}/taxonomy
    Note right of GW: Internal path, no auth required
    GW->>CC: Forward
    CC->>CS: syncTaxonomy(postId, request)
    CS->>CR: findBySlug(categorySlug)
    CR->>DB: SELECT
    CS->>TR: findBySlug(tagSlug) for each tag
    TR->>DB: SELECT
    CS->>DB: DELETE old mappings for postId
    CS->>DB: INSERT new post_category_mappings
    CS->>DB: INSERT new post_tag_mappings
    CS->>CR: Update postCount
    CS->>TR: Update postCount
    CS-->>CC: OK
    CC-->>GW: 200 OK
    GW-->>PS: Success

    Note over PS,RMQ: Post Deleted Event (RabbitMQ)
    PS->>RMQ: publish("post.deleted", {postId})
    RMQ->>CS: @RabbitListener onPostDeleted(payload)
    CS->>DB: DELETE FROM post_category_mappings WHERE postId=?
    CS->>DB: DELETE FROM post_tag_mappings WHERE postId=?
    CS->>CR: Decrement postCount
    CS->>TR: Decrement postCount
